      "clinical_rationale": "Performance drop on Montgomery County cohort reflects classic medical imaging domain shift: (1) Scanner calibration: Montgomery images were captured on an analog Eureka X-ray unit digitized at high bit-depth (4020x4892) vs Qatar/Dhaka digital DR capture; (2) Demographic & disease spectrum bias: Montgomery cases represent an urban US immigrant screening program with a high ratio of subtle apical fibrocavitary scarring and calcified granulomas, whereas training images predominantly feature florid lobar consolidations and extensive infiltrates."
    }
